    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/44924b50aaa3279d7a04c67f063b69fe.avif?t=1750947831\" data-has-big width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Explore eerie levels filled with a variety of puzzles that fully capture the liminality and unsettling atmosphere true to the Backrooms lore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(More levels will be added throughout the early access period.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/784a959c8e382901138907a2087dfc01.poster.avif?t=1750947831\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/784a959c8e382901138907a2087dfc01.webm?t=1750947831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/784a959c8e382901138907a2087dfc01.mp4?t=1750947831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/5c26bac4260b2276f8d5eb87d4cb11ff.avif?t=1750947831\" data-has-big width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Immerse yourself in the true Backrooms experience, whether alone or with friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Proximity chat adapts to the environment, ensuring the most immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/832923c9b5bfeb1058e5713012685874.poster.avif?t=1750947831\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/832923c9b5bfeb1058e5713012685874.webm?t=1750947831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/832923c9b5bfeb1058e5713012685874.mp4?t=1750947831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/a4951a6409589905a86e764a1e668bc2.avif?t=1750947831\" data-has-big width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the most authentic Backrooms experience with: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Realistic graphics </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Minimal UI for maximum immersion </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Dark and unsettling atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/f72c87b6ba2ea57fb96e9a80245e791e.poster.avif?t=1750947831\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/f72c87b6ba2ea57fb96e9a80245e791e.webm?t=1750947831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/f72c87b6ba2ea57fb96e9a80245e791e.mp4?t=1750947831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/f01ddff0d61bb0276ddc54e0d885564d.avif?t=1750947831\" data-has-big width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022All Levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022All Items<br>\u2022All Entities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more are designed to stay true to the Backrooms lore for the most authentic experience. (Based on Wikidot lore.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/388a1e05b5aee1fd4a984ff2bf6732f7.poster.avif?t=1750947831\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/388a1e05b5aee1fd4a984ff2bf6732f7.webm?t=1750947831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/388a1e05b5aee1fd4a984ff2bf6732f7.mp4?t=1750947831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/44924b50aaa3279d7a04c67f063b69fe.avif?t=1750947831\" data-has-big width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Explore eerie levels filled with a variety of puzzles that fully capture the liminality and unsettling atmosphere true to the Backrooms lore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(More levels will be added throughout the early access period.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/784a959c8e382901138907a2087dfc01.poster.avif?t=1750947831\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/784a959c8e382901138907a2087dfc01.webm?t=1750947831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/784a959c8e382901138907a2087dfc01.mp4?t=1750947831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/5c26bac4260b2276f8d5eb87d4cb11ff.avif?t=1750947831\" data-has-big width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Immerse yourself in the true Backrooms experience, whether alone or with friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Proximity chat adapts to the environment, ensuring the most immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/832923c9b5bfeb1058e5713012685874.poster.avif?t=1750947831\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/832923c9b5bfeb1058e5713012685874.webm?t=1750947831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/832923c9b5bfeb1058e5713012685874.mp4?t=1750947831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/a4951a6409589905a86e764a1e668bc2.avif?t=1750947831\" data-has-big width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the most authentic Backrooms experience with: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Realistic graphics </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Minimal UI for maximum immersion </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Dark and unsettling atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/f72c87b6ba2ea57fb96e9a80245e791e.poster.avif?t=1750947831\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/f72c87b6ba2ea57fb96e9a80245e791e.webm?t=1750947831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/f72c87b6ba2ea57fb96e9a80245e791e.mp4?t=1750947831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/f01ddff0d61bb0276ddc54e0d885564d.avif?t=1750947831\" data-has-big width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022All Levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022All Items<br>\u2022All Entities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more are designed to stay true to the Backrooms lore for the most authentic experience. (Based on Wikidot lore.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/388a1e05b5aee1fd4a984ff2bf6732f7.poster.avif?t=1750947831\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/388a1e05b5aee1fd4a984ff2bf6732f7.webm?t=1750947831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/388a1e05b5aee1fd4a984ff2bf6732f7.mp4?t=1750947831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
